	•	Algorithm Name: Multilayer perceptron (MLP), support vector machine (SVM), random forest classifier (RFC), and multivariate logistic regression
	•	Input Variables (Data Modality): Imaging (CT/CXR/Echo), Tabular (EMR/Clinical data), Donor metrics
	•	Comparator / Standard of Care: None
