	•	Hyperparameter Tuning Reported: Yes
	•	Section 3 Comments/Quotes: The paper states that “four ML algorithms were developed,” namely logistic regression, SVM, RFC, and MLP, and the best model was MLP. Inputs combined pre-LTx clinical data with CT-derived features from deep-learning segmentation and donor-recipient size-matching ratios. The models used repeated stratified 5-fold cross-validation with five runs and randomized grid search. Feature reduction included p<0.10 screening, VIF filtering, and lasso-based elimination. No SHAP/LIME-style explainability was reported.  ￼

